y/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>As-Built BIM: Hospital &#038; Healthcare Facility</b><span>UAE</span><span class=\"l\">LOD 300–400</span></a></li></ul></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"bone pad\"><div class=\"wrap faqx\"><div><p class=\"lab\">FAQ</p><h2 class=\"h2\" style=\"margin-top:18px\">Hiring <em>Scan-to-BIM Specialists.</em></h2><p class=\"lead\" style=\"margin-top:20px\">Anything else? <a class=\"u\" href=\"/contact/\">Ask ENGISOFT.</a></p></div><div class=\"qa\"><details><summary>Do your specialists carry out the laser scanning?<i></i></summary><p>The scan is usually supplied by a survey partner or the client; our specialists work from the registered point cloud.</p></details><details><summary>What accuracy can be achieved?<i></i></summary><p>Accuracy depends on the scan and the agreed LOD. Tolerances are agreed per project; the published Sharjah project was modelled within ±5 mm.</p></details></div></div></section>\n<section class=\"pad\"><div class=\"wrap\">\n  <div class=\"head\"><div><p class=\"lab\">Other disciplines</p><h2 class=\"h2\">More <em>professionals.</em></h2></div><a class=\"btn ghost\" href=\"/engineering-staffing/\">Engineering staffing <i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#8599;</i></a></div>\n  <ul class=\"rel\"><li><a href=\"/engineering-staffing/bim-architects/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>BIM Architects</b><span>Architecture</span><span class=\"l\">&rarr;</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/engineering-staffing/architectural-bim-engineers/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>Architectural BIM Engineers</b><span>Architecture</span><span class=\"l\">&rarr;</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/engineering-staffing/structural-bim-engineers/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>Structural BIM Engineers</b><span>Structure</span><span class=\"l\">&rarr;</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/engineering-staffing/mep-bim-engineers/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>MEP BIM Engineers</b><span>MEP</span><span class=\"l\">&rarr;</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/engineering-staffing/m